{"id":"n15524-3-7","stage":2,"title":"무대 · 场所","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15524-3-7-1","ko":"영화의 무대가 되는 곳이 우리 고향이야.","zh":"电影故事发生的地方就是我的家乡。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화의","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무대가","meaning":"场所","explanation":"무대：场所；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"3","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는","meaning":"形成，完成","explanation":"되다：形成，完成；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"12","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고향이야.","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"64389d2db12c00f1","term":"무대","zh":"场所","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3","entryId":"15524","definition":"(喻义)艺术作品中成为故事发生的背景的地方。","pronunciation":["무ː대"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"形成，完成","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事物或现象产生或被制造。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3e389372fc9369b41d7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15524-3-7-2","ko":"그래? 정말 아름다운 곳이던데!","zh":"是吗？看着真漂亮！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아름다운","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이던데!","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ad24a4a248e148b3c5e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.038,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15524","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5515,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？看着真漂亮！","电影故事发生的地方就是我的家乡。","妈妈，今天也要刷牙再睡觉吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["电影故事发生的地方就是我的家乡。","妈妈，今天也要刷牙再睡觉吗？","是吗？看着真漂亮！"],"answer":2}]}
